    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates presents this fine four-bedroom family home with garage situated in this quiet cul de sac development.\n\nAccommodation briefly consists of an entrance hall with guest w.c., sitting room, dining room and kitchen downstairs, with four bedrooms and shower room upstairs.\n\nThe property has double glazed uPVC windows, gas fired central heating and bright spacious accommodation throughout.\n\nThis property is ideally located within a stroll of the many amenities that Glasnevin has to offer, including local schools and shops and it is within easy access to the Botanic Gardens, Bons Secours Hospital, M2 / M50, Dublin Airport and the City Centre. \n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nGENERAL POINTS, SERVICES & UTILITIES: \n-BER is E and BER number is 107378853.\n-Gas fired central heating.\n-Double glazed uPVC windows.\n-Garage.\n\nGARDENS: \nSouth facing walled rear garden which is approximately 7 meters in length. Drive-in to the front of the property which leads to the garage and provides off-street parking for 2-3 cars. \n\nVIEWING:\nBy Appointment Only\n\nNEGOTIATOR: \nFiona McGowan MIPAV - PHIBSBORO OFFICE (01) 8304000\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL:\nWith understairs storage.\n\nGUEST W.C.\nGuest w.c. and wash hand basin.\n\nSITTING ROOM: 4.0m x 3.4m\nSituated to the front of the property.\n\nDINING ROOM: 4.7m x 3.5m\nSituated to the rear of the property.\n\nKITCHEN: 3.1m x 3.3m (max measurement)\nRange of fitted wall and floor units with stainless steel sink with tiled splashback. Integrated oven, hob and extractor fan. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Gas boiler. Door to garage\n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nLANDING:\nWith hotpress.\n\nBEDROOM 1: 4.6m x 3.5m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the property.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.6m x 3.5m\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property.\n\nBEDROOM 3: 4.6m x 2.3m\nDouble bedroom to the rear\n\nBEDROOM 4: 3.3m x 2.3m\nFront bedroom.\n\nSHOWER ROOM: 2.7m x 1.5m\nWith 3 piece white suite comprising of w.c., wash hand basin and Triton shower. Tiled floor. Mirrored storage press over sink.\n\nGARAGE: 4.4m x 2.4m\n\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA:\nc. 112 sq.m. (not including the garage c. 10sqm)\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious Family Home. </li><li> South facing private walled rear garden </li><li> Garage </li><li> Cul de sac location </li><li> Within a stroll of local schools and shops. </li><li> Within a stroll of the National Botanic Gardens </li><li> Good transport links to the City Centre </li><li> Dublin Airport is c. 20 minutes drive </li><li> Easy access to the M2/M50</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E<br>BER No: 107378853<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 292.88 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Coming past Glasnevin Cemetery take a left into Claremont Crescent. Continue along as the road veres around to the right and No. 67 is on the left hand side. \n\n"
      },
      {
